# The CUDA build copies only the version verifier. Keep repository history,
# local caches, credentials, models, and unrelated untracked files out of the
# context, without constraining the other vendors' containerfiles.
**
!docker/
!docker/cuda/
!docker/cuda/containerfile
!.github/
!.github/scripts/
!.github/scripts/cuda/
!.github/scripts/cuda/verify_environment.py
